      "description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.Cz6U0ps98sYN8jMH\" data-id=\"Cz6U0ps98sYN8jMH\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Conquer 5</a>: inflicts <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> on the target.</p></li><li><p>You deal <strong>5 bonus damage</strong> when you attack a <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> target.</p></li><li><p>You cannot equip a <strong>Shield</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
